From c38fe3681a5549a27122158c4a1bca41e5452eab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stephan-xyz <stephan@zehrer.xyz>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 09:45:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] dwc2d: CDC Ethernet network adapter

Adds bulk transfers on separate channels (one kept pending for receive)
and a CDC Ethernet (ECM) adapter on top of driver-network, so the
network stack can use a USB network device. The daemon now reports ready
after enumeration, because the network stack only looks for adapters at
startup.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
